// A `Distinct` constraint naming a sibling announce slot that doesn't exist
// [CR#115.7e,601.2c]. (The old twin fixtures read a `Target(n)` slot index —
// that spelling left the grammar with cards-fidelity-target-sunset, so the
// sibling-index check is the rule's remaining trigger; Spec.idr's
// `tBadTargetRange` twin follows with idris-core-v2.)
Normal(
  name: "Reject Distinct Sibling Range",
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Targeted(
      targets: [Distinct([1], AnyTarget)],
      effect: DealDamage(It, 1),
    )),
  ],
)
